WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.670
Flaming Dance Battle

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.950
I wish it would stop raining.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:49.760
Joey, what's up with Shizuka's operation?

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:56.780
Thanks to Yugi, she's been admitted to a hospital with a world-class eye surgeon.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:59.100
She's having her surgery soon.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.160
You'll visit her, right?

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.640
I don't know.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:11.810
Because Shizuka and I have been living separately after my parents split a long time ago.

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:13.890
What are you talking about?

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:15.270
You should visit her.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:16.940
I'll go with you.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.780
What are you coming?

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:22.880
Because unlike you, Shizuka is cute.

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:24.100
Introduce me to her.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.020
How dare you!

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:27.090
I knew you were up to something!

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.440
Anzu!

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.800
Yugi.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:42.840
Anzu, umm...

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.240
Are you free this Sunday?

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.410
Huh?  Yeah.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:52.970
My other self seems depressed these days.

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:55.650
He won't open up to me.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:59.390
I think that he'll cheer up if he sees you.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:02.060
The other Yugi?

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:03.100
Yeah.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.350
Anyway, I have to help Grandpa at the store.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:07.300
Wait!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.540
Domino Station at 10 o'clock on Sunday.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:14.170
That's short notice...

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.570
Which should I wear?

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:28.960
This is a hard decision.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.920
Why are you getting dressed up?

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:35.760
I'm going to meet Anzu.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:37.950
Oh, you have a date.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.550
You're finally going for it.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:41.930
Good luck, partner.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.940
But it's not me who's actually meeting her.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:53.010
A date with the other Yugi...

00:03:53.940 --> 00:04:00.000
Yugi says the other Yugi is another person who lives inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.200
Why am I feeling so nervous?

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:13.480
You're up, my other self.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.470
Hey!  What are you up to?

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:34.110
He's not talking.

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:35.760
This is tricky.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:39.390
I have an idea!  Want to go here?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.770
The Ancient Egypt Exhibition.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.390
Why go there?

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.330
Look at this symbol.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:50.330
It's the same as your Millennium Puzzle.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:54.840
That means the Puzzle might have something to do with Egypt.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.840
Did I say something wrong?

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:06.080
No.  It's just that this morning, he was so focused when he was dressing up in front of the mirror.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.530
I was wondering why.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:13.860
Since he cares about others, he hides what he really thinks.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.860
Yugi was worried about you.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:23.450
He shouldn't be worrying about me when he doesn't realize who he loves.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:24.250
What?

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.740
He's just like me.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:30.110
We both don't know where we want to go.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.440
Where to go?

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.450
Who am I?

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.320
Where did I come from?

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:38.620
And I don't know where I'm going.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:43.800
This Yugi is clearly different than the usual Yugi.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.820
This Yugi lives in the Millennium Puzzle.

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:48.830
But it's fine.

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:50.830
I'm fine as is.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:54.570
I don't know where I'm going either.

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:55.830
Nobody knows.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:03.710
I've told you before that my dream is to become a dancer, so I'm going to America after I graduate.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:04.350
Yeah.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:08.640
And even as we sit here, that time is coming.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.250
Time is finite.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:15.190
Don't worry.  I know you'll achieve your dream.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:20.050
I know that achieving my dream won't be easy.

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:25.030
But if I even have the slightest chance, I want to go for it!

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.650
Let's go, Yugi!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.140
Let's hit the town!

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:31.630
There are many places we can go!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.140
Where are we going, Anzu?

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.870
We don't have to choose.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.000
I didn't know there was a card store here.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.480
You didn't know?

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.170
They opened recently.

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:00.720
Want to go inside?

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:01.400
Yeah.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.090
I can't decide which one to buy.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:12.040
This is the happiest I've seen him today.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.050
Luck is on my side!

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:17.330
Lightforce Sword is a good card.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:18.690
Congrats!

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:20.230
My partner will be happy too!

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:23.050
Let's go there next!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:24.890
Sure...

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.100
You did it!

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:33.120
What should we play?

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.960
Nice!  Keep it up!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.780
Dammit!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.580
Wow!  He won again!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.260
Step Johnny is the best here!

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.000
Who's next?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.260
Who's going to challenge me?

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.250
A dance battle game?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.930
Looks fun!

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:10.330
Hey girl, wanna battle me?

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.340
You can ignore him.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.410
I never run from a dance battle.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.490
Nobody can stop me!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.200
Anzu!

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:24.740
It's fine.

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:25.640
Let's go.

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.320
You've got guts.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.240
You're a cutie!

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.820
Don't let Johnny upstage you!

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:34.400
Let's just have fun.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.920
I'll go easy on you.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.990
I don't need you to go easy on me.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.260
I see.

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:41.900
But if you lose, you gotta hang out with me tonight.

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:46.830
That's why you took the stage.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:47.980
You annoy me.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.040
Music, standby!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:51.200
Go!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.150
Wow!

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:26.200
They're both perfect so far!

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:28.380
She's having a great match against Johnny!

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:48.630
That's dirty, Step Johnny!

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.530
You're doing great, girl!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.140
Impressive, Anzu.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:59.220
I missed?  Me?

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:01.420
I can't believe it!

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:02.910
She's incredible!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.190
Johnny is in trouble!

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:08.980
Oh no!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.930
She defeated Step Johnny!

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:26.290
That was fun!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:32.740
Even a 100-yen game can make me confident in my dreams.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.610
My dreams...

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:39.180
But I can keep the status quo by not pursuing my dreams.

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:42.280
You're really fine with that?

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.970
I want to know more about myself.

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:49.020
I want to know where I should go.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:54.240
But if I keep the status quo, I can stay within his heart forever.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.430
And that's also what he wants.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:59.910
Yugi is worried about the other Yugi.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:04.940
I also want you to stay forever, but...

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:11.550
Even if you have two hearts, you must face your own heart.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:14.820
So be honest with yourself.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:17.920
Hey!

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:21.540
You can't quit while you're ahead.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.490
The game is over!

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:26.560
Then let's duel this time.

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:27.800
Duel?

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:30.690
I'll stop if I lose the duel.

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.940
If I win, we're hanging out.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:35.080
C'mon...

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:38.950
Why don't you hang out with me instead?

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:41.640
It's none of your business!

00:11:41.640 --> 00:11:44.780
You're just trying to show off in front of her!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:46.700
Will you let me handle this?

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.350
Umm, okay.

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:53.020
Fine.  She'll be mine one way or another.

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:57.590
But if I win, you'll never bother Anzu again!

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:03.200
Sure, but how can you defeat me when I'm undefeated in 400 street duels?

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:35.530
Why do you dance?

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:38.530
For the fame, of course.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:41.290
It gets me the ladies.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.270
For some people, dancing is their dream!

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:48.110
I won't let you disgrace Anzu's dream!

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:51.320
Don't be so childish!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:54.320
You'll never dance a real dance!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.420
Let's go!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.460
Duel!

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.950
I'll go first.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.290
Sonic Maid in attack position!

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:05.800
I end my turn.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:07.840
My turn.

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:09.420
Good.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.110
I'll play this!

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:13.570
Celtic Guardian!

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:16.240
Battle!

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:18.940
Celtic Guardian attacks Sonic Maid!

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:30.080
Slashing a lady with a sword?  He's horrible!

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:31.820
It's my turn.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:38.730
Here's my cute Water Omotics in attack position!

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:45.470
What?  Is he using a fun deck?

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.100
Fun deck?

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:50.600
Yeah.  It's not a deck designed to win.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:54.690
It's a themed deck that appeals to your interests.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:59.710
His deck is a Musician Deck.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:03.320
If you underestimate me, you'll be in trouble.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:08.220
I'll show you my soulful dueling.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.630
Go ahead and show me your soul.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:17.060
I end my turn.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:21.700
Spirit of the Harp in defense position!

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:29.410
Then the spell card Chorus of Sanctuary!

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:37.580
This card raises the defense points of defending monsters by 500.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:40.550
I end my turn.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:46.120
I thought he was a loser, but looking at how he constructed his deck...

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:49.060
...he's a straight shooter when it comes to dueling.

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:52.800
But a duel is a duel!

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.340
I'll end this!

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:58.370
Step Johnny, your showtime is over!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:01.880
Curse of Dragon in attack position!

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.170
Here I go.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.150
Battle!

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:07.550
Hell Flame!

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.500
Oh no!

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.920
I forgot to switch it to defense position!

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.130
He's so careless.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:20.680
Where's the soul you were bragging about?

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:21.880
I'm far from done!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.860
My stage is just beginning!

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:27.530
Here I go!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.270
Witch of the Black Forest in defense position!

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:33.480
What?

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:35.280
It's not a fun deck?

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:37.380
I'll play this now.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:40.600
I activate the spell card Polymerization!

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:44.860
I fuse Witch of the Black Forest and Lady of Faith in my hand!

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:53.120
I summon Musician King!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:54.780
Battle!

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:56.900
I attack Celtic Guardian!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:07.920
Celtic Guardian...

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:13.650
Can you keep up with Musician King's soulful guitar?

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:17.730
I'm one step closer to a fun night with her.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:23.600
I set a card and end my turn.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.430
Do your best, Yugi.

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.060
My turn!

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:34.470
Curse of Dragon attacks Musician King!

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:37.260
You fell for it!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:38.500
I activate my trap!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:39.710
What?

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.880
I equip Metalmorph!

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:55.900
This card powers up Musician King into Heavy Metal King.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.490
Take the Devil's Kiss!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.370
Now you have no monsters on your field.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:15.370
Is he actually strong?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.120
Giant Soldier of Stone in defense position!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.610
I end my turn!

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:24.580
You're all talk and no skills.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:26.440
It's my turn!

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:30.690
Metalmorph does more than increase its attack points.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.690
Let's go, Heavy Metal King!

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:37.420
Destroy Giant Soldier of Stone with Devil's Kiss!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.770
Giant Soldier of Stone!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:56.280
I know that half of the attacked monster's attack points are added to the monster equipped with Metalmorph.

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.290
My turn!

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:01.520
I summon Dark Magician in attack position!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:05.830
Dark Magician attacks Heavy Metal King!

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.160
You fool!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:11.230
Did you forget that I have Metalmorph?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.350
Dark Magician will be destroyed.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:16.440
You're wrong.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:17.300
What?

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:19.640
It's about Metalmorph's effect.

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.550
Heavy Metal King is destroyed!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:32.050
Why didn't Metalmorph's effect activate?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:41.060
When a monster equipped with this card attacks, it gains half the attack points of the attack target.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:49.780
So when Heavy Metal King attacks, it gains half of Dark Magician's attack points.

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:58.300
But since it was under attack, this effect didn't activate, so its attack points remained at 2050.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.460
You were careless, Step Johnny.

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:03.820
Is this for real?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.600
Who are you?

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:06.820
Tell me your name!

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:08.320
Yugi.

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:09.920
Yugi Muto!

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:14.200
I've heard the name before...

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:15.930
It can't be!

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:20.670
Are you the Yugi that defeated Pegasus at Duelist Kingdom?

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:25.130
When it comes to having soul for this game, I take a back seat to no one.

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.340
It's your turn!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:31.310
Damn!  I quit!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.050
I can never defeat the king of duelists!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:45.520
If you have the time to run from yourself and chase after girls, then put everything you have into dancing!

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:47.450
Everything into dancing?

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:51.530
You're better at dancing than dueling.

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:54.280
I don't need to hear this from an amateur.

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:57.220
I know my own talents.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:20:00.770
Becoming a pro dancer is an unachievable dream.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:03.470
Have you ever gone to an audition?

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.180
Uhh, I have.

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:07.520
How many times?

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.940
Once.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:09.950
Once?

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:13.860
You failed one time and gave up?

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.980
You don't know how it feels to be a loser!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.860
I've failed dozens of times!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:21.190
You did?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.610
But I'm not giving up.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.440
I'll never achieve anything if I run from myself.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:31.520
Your future begins when you face yourself!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:32.800
I see.

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:33.840
You also...

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:40.110
Hey.

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:44.790
I'll try again.

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.300
Good luck.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:54.080
Did I sound like a know-it-all?

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:54.790
No.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.360
Let's go to the Ancient Egypt Exhibition.

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:04.900
There are clues to my past here.

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:12.720
I knew I had to come here, but something in my heart told me not to.

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:15.450
I was afraid of learning the truth.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:18.880
But I've made up my mind after meeting you today.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:19.780
Yugi...

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:22.100
Who am I?

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:23.820
Where did I come from?

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:26.140
The answers are here.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:27.380
Let's go!

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:29.590
Yeah!  Face it with confidence!

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:47.870
We go to the museum to find clues to his lost memories.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:54.620
We see the Pharaoh, who looks like Yugi, carved into a 3,000 year-old tablet.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:59.950
The other Yugi believes he's the soul of this Pharaoh.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.300
The battle to regain his memories is starting?

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:07.580
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
This City Becomes Battle City!

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:09.170
Duel, standby!

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:28.060
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:33.430
I feel like I've been here

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:43.110
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:43.410 --> 00:22:54.620
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:02.130
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:07.400
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:07.970 --> 00:23:12.510
Will never change

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:17.780
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:22.980
To be who I am

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:28.220
I've kept searching for something

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:32.930
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:35.860
I learned that's the answer

00:23:36.660 --> 00:23:42.970
From now until forever...
